 ><div class="siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget"></div></div></section><section id="nav_menu-4" class="widget clearfix widget_nav_menu"></section></aside><div class="column column-content single"><div id="post-13691" class="post-13691 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-info category-news ja"><h1 class="title-header">2026年企画展Ⅱ「熊楠の結婚」</h1><div class="entry-meta"> <span class="by-author">投稿者: <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://www.minakata.org/author/minakata/" title="minakata のすべての投稿を表示" rel="author">minakata</a></span> </span>in <span class="category"><a href="https://www.minakata.org/category/info/" rel="category tag">お知らせ</a>, <a href="https://www.minakata.org/category/news/" rel="category tag">ニュース</a></span> 投稿日: <span class="datetime"><a href="https://www.minakata.org/2026_exh2/" title="14:45" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2026-09-24T14:45:44+09:00" pubdate>2026年9月24日</time></a></span></div><div class="entry-content clearfix"><p><span style="color: #ff0000; font-size: 14pt;"><strong>南方熊楠顕彰館開館20周年記念</strong></span><br /> <span style="font-size: 18pt; color: #ff0000;"><strong>2026年企画展Ⅱ「熊楠の結婚」</strong></span></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 27px;"><tbody><tr style="height: 27px;"><td style="width: 100%; height: 27px;"><a href="https://www.minakata.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7b5eb4c479f88592fad58f5a1353b45d-1-scaled.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="lazy lazy-hidden alignleft size-large wp-image-13695" src="//www.minakata.org/wp-content/plugins/a3-lazy-load/assets/images/lazy_placeholder.gif" data-lazy-type="image" data-src="https://www.minakata.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7b5eb4c479f88592fad58f5a1353b45d-1-713x1000.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="842" srcset="" data-srcset="https://www.minakata.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/7b5eb4c479f88592fad58f5a1353b45d-1-713x1000.jp